= A rightward turn?

Following deep political instability produced by the failure of the Sejm to build a stable governing majority[? if president != 'Wojciechowski' and president != "Zamoyski" : and the result of the presidential election. ?]

The parties will meet in Lanckorona to discuss how to approach the current problems plaguing **<span style="color: #CCC;">Pol</span><span style="color: #DC143C;">and</span>**.

